---Processes a checkout via credit card information, will tokenize and save the card for reuse by the customer in the future.
---
---`POST /checkout/card/{merchantId}`
---Errors: PreconditionFailed, CustomerBlocked, VerificationRequired.
---@param input coinflow.checkout.CardCheckoutRequest
---@return coinflow.checkout.CardCheckoutResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:card_checkout(input) end

---Card on File Authorized
---
---Checks if a user is authorized for card on file transactions with this card.
---
---It is recommended to call this endpoint to confirm card on file transactions can be performed with a card before attempting any session (such as an auction) involving card on file transactions.
---
---`POST /checkout/card-on-file-authorized`
---Errors: Forbidden, Gone, PreconditionFailed.
---@param input coinflow.checkout.CardOnFileAuthorizedRequest
---@return coinflow.checkout.CheckoutCardOnFileAuthorizedResponse200? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:card_on_file_authorized(input) end

---Card On File Checkout
---
---Processes a Card On File Transaction using a saved card from a previous Customer Initiated Transaction (CIT).
---
---This endpoint can only be used if the customer is actively involved
---in the purchase flow and has explicitly granted their authorization
---to charge their card.
---
---`POST /checkout/card-on-file`
---Errors: Forbidden, Gone, PreconditionFailed.
---@param input coinflow.checkout.CardOnFileCheckoutRequest
---@return coinflow.checkout.CheckoutResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:card_on_file_checkout(input) end

