---
---`POST /checkout/fees`
---@param input coinflow.checkout.GetFeesRequest
---@return coinflow.checkout.PartialRecordPaymentMethodsFeeOptionArrayOrFeeDetailOrCurrencyCents? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
